<h2>Program & System — Tamanna System</h2>

<p>The "Tamanna system" is the automation layer for bd-king-r7. It includes:</p>
<ol>
  <li>Auto-sync agents that pull/push code, run fixers and builds.</li>
  <li>Central orchestrator for tracking runs, failures, and history.</li>
  <li>Web UI (this site) for documentation and quick status.</li>
</ol>

<h3>How it runs</h3>
<p>Agents run periodically (configurable interval). They try to auto-fix (format/lint), build, and only commit & push when the build is successful. Failed builds leave changes staged for manual review.</p>